# Copy to .env for local fetch testing (never commit .env).
# AirNow improves official AQI when set. AirGradient community PM2.5 needs no key.
# COtrip unlocks live RWIS weather stations, incidents, planned events, and road conditions.
# FIRMS_MAP_KEY unlocks NASA FIRMS VIIRS active-fire detections (free at firms.modaps.eosdis.nasa.gov).
AIRNOW_API_KEY=
COTRIP_API_KEY=
FIRMS_MAP_KEY=

# NOTIFY_WEBHOOK_URL is Actions-only (GitHub Actions secret) — not used by local fetch.
